{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 23, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.2-3b-instruct", "content": "John woke up to the sound of his alarm blaring in his ear. He reached over to turn it off, but as he did, he noticed something strange. The walls of his bedroom were made of a pixelated material, and the furniture looked like it was made of cubes. Confused, John sat up and looked around, trying to shake off the feeling that something was off. As he stood up and looked out the window, he saw a sky with blocks of color that seemed to be made of code. Suddenly, it clicked - he was inside a video game.\n\nJohn stumbled through the digital world, trying to wrap his head around what was happening. He found himself in a medieval town, complete with pixelated villagers and a castle made of stone blocks. As he walked through the town, people stared at him in confusion, whispering to each other about the \"new player\" who had suddenly appeared. John realized that he was the main character of this game, and that his every move was being tracked and recorded. Panic set in as he realized that he was trapped in this virtual world, with no way to escape. *** \n\nJohn's grip on his surroundings tightened as he thought of all the things he could do. He started by trying to find a way to break free, but every door he opened led to more questions. He encountered various characters, including a wise old sage who told him that the only way to escape was to find the \"Easter egg\" - a hidden secret that only a select few could find. As John continued his journey, he encountered many obstacles, but he refused to give up, driven by the hope of finding a way back home.", "logprobs": [{"token": "John", "logprob": -3.0421082973480225}, {"token": " woke", "logprob": -0.06554623693227768}, {"token": " up", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.0004814896092284471}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -1.0247187614440918}, {"token": " sound", "logprob": -0.1765698343515396}, {